---

This project injects a DLL into the game process `hoi4.exe` to read and write
game memory, and calls game engine functions directly. It is intended for
SINGLE-PLAYER use only. Using it in multiplayer may violate the game's terms of
service. This project is not affiliated with Paradox Interactive and contains
no game assets.
